msgctxt "260"
msgid "You're Imagawa, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "272"
msgid "That's right. Who are you?"
msgstr "Ehm, esatto. Tu chi sei?"

msgctxt "284"
msgid "I'm looking into the Café Alps murder from six years ago."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "296"
msgid "What!?"
msgstr "Cosa!?"

msgctxt "320"
msgid "(Let's see. What to ask...?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "332"
msgid ""
"They say you weren't at the café the day of the murder.\r\n"
"Is that true?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "344"
msgid "Yes. I spent the whole day at home."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "356"
msgid "Alone?"
msgstr "Da solo?"

msgctxt "368"
msgid "No. Some friends came over and we played video games."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "380"
msgid "And these friends corroborated your alibi?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "392"
msgid "That's right. So it wasn't me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "416"
msgid "Do you know anything about the man seen fleeing the scene?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "428"
msgid ""
"No, I didn't see anything! I didn't say anything! I didn't\r\n"
"hear anything!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "440"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "464"
msgid "Can you think of anybody who'd wanna kill Oda?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "476"
msgid "I don't know anything! Don't ask me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "488"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "512"
msgid "Your prints weren't found on the murder weapon, were they?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "524"
msgid ""
"Next, you're going to start saying I wore gloves! Well,\r\n"
"you're wrong! I wasn't anywhere near the café that day!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "536"
msgid "Guess it stands to reason your prints wouldn't be on it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "560"
msgid ""
"I don't know anything about the murder. Just leave me\r\n"
"alone!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "572"
msgid "(Man, this guy's got a persecution complex.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "596"
msgid ""
"Lemme know if you remember anything from around the time of\r\n"
"the murder. Doesn't matter how small."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "608"
msgid "I didn't do anything! Honest! You have to believe me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "620"
msgid ""
"Everyone's saying I'm the murderer, aren't they? Aren't\r\n"
"they!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "632"
msgid "No. Nobody's saying anything about you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "644"
msgid ""
"I don't believe you! Everyone hated me at that café. They\r\n"
"used to harass me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "656"
msgid "Harassed you how?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "668"
msgid ""
"Someone even stole my wallet, CDs, and uniform out of my\r\n"
"locker on the day of the murder."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "680"
msgid "Are you sure the police didn't pick them up as evidence?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "692"
msgid "Absolutely sure! Someone was harassing me, I tell you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "704"
msgid "(So <Color:7>somebody stole Imagawa's things<Color:Default>, huh...?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "728"
msgid "You got <Color:8>Imagawa's Testimony<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "764"
msgid "I'm looking into the Café Alps murder from six years ago."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "776"
